Securitize Stocks are now live.

Here’s who’s supporting trading now, and who’s building the venues and market connections for their future:

Securitize Stocks launched on @Solana, with transactions settling in USDC.

@NYSE is building a 24/7 digital venue where Securitize Stocks are expected to trade upon the venue’s launch.

@okx and @ICE_Markets are building OKXICE, a planned Tokenized Securities Venue where Securitize Stocks are expected to be available in the future.

Securitize Stocks are designed to support additional onchain utility over time, including supported lending and collateral markets like @aave.

@jumptrading serves as a market maker on our Solana PropAMM, supporting liquidity, price discovery and execution.

@Ripple Prime plans to support Securitize Stocks and explore bringing them into its broader institutional trading ecosystem.

@RQDClearing is supporting the framework connecting onchain trading to established clearing, custody and settlement infrastructure.

We’re glad to have these partners working alongside us, and we look forward to continuing that work as Securitize Stocks develop.
